{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾慧雲入行逾40年，演活過不少小人物的角色，戲路相當之廣的她，善於演諸事八卦的左鄰右里、多管閒事的人物，紮實演技深入民心，獲封「御用師奶」美譽。</p><p>她曾演出過不少膾炙人口的作品，除了90年的經典劇《壹號皇庭》、《大時代》、《刑事偵緝檔案》外，近</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.215711+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_hash":"9f9d2eb7f9815463a3005c91525e5e3ab6757666c219674d4f7a70ff334dc5c2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}